results/telemetry/github-snapshot/open-pulls.json:5728:  "body": "### Motivation\n\nIssue #513 tracks the global polynomial-pair construction in paper\n`lem:qld-4-7`, `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex`,\nlines 1267-1404. The theorem must produce the measurements from a passing\nprojective strategy, with universal error constants chosen before the strategy\nand admissible parameters.\n\n### Description\n\nProve `exists_globalPairWitness` with its public statement unchanged. Construct\nboth players' projective polynomial-pair measurements and establish all four\npoint-consistency conclusions. The point and line measurements used in the\nconstruction are derived internally from the strategy.\n\nBound the actual completed-measurement error by the required `deltaQld`,\nretaining the two input errors and the eighth-root rounding loss. Record the\nprovenance of recovered proofs and synchronize the completed theorem's\nblueprint proof marker. Separate line obligations and auxiliary source-route\ndiscrepancies remain explicitly documented.\n\n### Testing\n\nAt proof checkpoint `097579724e42362f7b28aa850eb19213198dd41e`, focused Lean\nchecks, the QPBT aggregate, blueprint web and synchronization, declaration\nchecks, and normal hooks passed. Full signature and transitive-axiom queries\nfor the source theorem and thirteen construction/scalar roots contain only\nthe standard axioms. The mathematical audit is\n`audits/2026-09-14_issue-513_actual-error-absorption.md`.\n\nAfter integration with main `391d6fca`, checkpoint `ac1be4b9` passed focused\nLean and aggregate checks, normal hooks, merge-loss guards, and all thirteen\naxiom queries. The full theorem signature and proof are unchanged.\n\nPR535's existing branch is reconciled at\n`0bc16bc27b6043fe49e3f49dd4e02d79211596ec`, preserving both histories and all\nsource-only and target-only paths. Focused Lean checks, normal hooks and\nmerge-loss guards passed. The full signature and thirteen axiom queries are\nbyte-identical to the completed source evidence.\n\nFull CI and independent review are pending on the published reconciled head.\n\nThe initial CI build and integrity gates passed; PDF rendering found four uses\nof a paper-only macro. Commit `fc7bf34e` replaces them with the blueprint's\nexisting notation. It changes no Lean statement, proof or completion marker;\nthe subsequent canonical CI run must verify the corrected rendering.\n\n---\nCloses #513\n",
